WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.287
The rest of the gap table is
about everything around the write.

2
00:00:03.287 --> 00:00:07.215
The samples hard-code worldwide
hosts, use a preview version,

3
00:00:07.215 --> 00:00:10.513
and in one case send a request
with no version at all.

4
00:00:10.513 --> 00:00:12.977
They create one credential
at a time by hand,

5
00:00:12.977 --> 00:00:16.400
so nothing notices a credential
someone added in the portal.

6
00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:18.938
They don't check the limits
Learn itself states.

7
00:00:18.938 --> 00:00:23.198
And they stop at creation: no
record of the identity's roles,

8
00:00:23.198 --> 00:00:25.151
no parallel run, no disable.

9
00:00:25.151 --> 00:00:28.956
The verdict: use the samples as
the model for the three writes,

10
00:00:28.956 --> 00:00:33.740
but not as the conversion, because they
accept the wrong subject in silence.
